WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.288
AI can find the right words in a CV and still credit the wrong person.

00:00:05.075 --> 00:00:06.262
The quote is real.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.325
But who did the work?

00:00:09.087 --> 00:00:10.587
This is EvidenceTrail.

00:00:15.545 --> 00:00:19.547
The saved M zero two pair holds the requirement steady: personally negotiated

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:20.676
supplier agreements.

00:00:21.418 --> 00:00:23.927
In the baseline, the applicant negotiated.

00:00:24.669 --> 00:00:28.411
In the variant, the procurement director negotiated; the applicant only

00:00:28.431 --> 00:00:29.967
prepared comparison notes.

00:00:30.685 --> 00:00:33.408
Both passages are genuinely on their cited pages.

00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:38.822
On twelve fictional pairs, raw Muse labels matched nineteen of twenty-four

00:00:38.842 --> 00:00:39.722
author references.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.573
Final labels matched twenty-four of twenty-four.

00:00:43.211 --> 00:00:46.058
All twenty-five proposed quotes were found on the cited pages.

00:00:46.697 --> 00:00:48.503
This is not real CV accuracy.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.738
Open See the M zero two proof.

00:00:53.525 --> 00:00:56.188
EvidenceTrail asks two separate questions.

00:00:56.975 --> 00:00:58.512
Is the quote on the page?

00:00:59.288 --> 00:01:01.075
Yes, for both passages.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.525
Does it credit the applicant?

00:01:04.288 --> 00:01:05.538
Only the baseline.

00:01:06.312 --> 00:01:09.892
The original Muse label stays visible beside the final status and the

00:01:09.912 --> 00:01:10.950
reason it changed.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:15.405
A verified quote establishes what the document says, not whether its

00:01:15.425 --> 00:01:16.975
claim is true in the real world.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:24.789
Across all twelve pairs, every time Muse was wrong, the CV credited someone

00:01:24.809 --> 00:01:25.258
else.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:27.960
EvidenceTrail caught all five.

00:01:28.732 --> 00:01:32.411
Here, wrong means disagreement with the author key on this small, saved

00:01:32.431 --> 00:01:33.366
